Project Mind modifications: reuse filterbank setup and overlapping filterbank
and normalized LFR frames, and decode immutable ONNX tensors once. The fixed
window tail uses persistent causal caches through the stable first 98 frames;
the last two LFR edge frames run on temporary caches. This tail adaptation is
Project Mind behavior, preserving its former finite-window decisions, rather
than an unchanged upstream streaming frontend. Unused quantized model conversion
and diagnostics were removed for the fixed bundled model.
